<title>MEXICO: Continental Airlines new Mexico routes.</title>
<headline>Continental Airlines new Mexico routes.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Continental Airlines announced on Tuesday it will soon begin flying new routes between Houston, Texas, and northern Mexican cities of Saltillo and Tampico.</p>
<p>&quot;We reckon we will begin operations on May 15. The only thing that has held us up is the delivery of Brazilian jets,&quot; said Luis Rodriguez, general manager of Continental in the northern Mexican industrial city of Monterrey.</p>
<p>Rodriguez said fares on the Houston-Saltillo route could cost between $138-150.</p>
<p>((--Jacqueline Lerma, Monterrey bureau +528 345-7677))</p>
